# This file contains the initial defaults for go command configuration.
# Values set by 'go env -w' and written to the user's go/env file override these.
# The environment overrides everything else.

# Use the Go module mirror and checksum database by default.
# See https://proxy.golang.org for details. The ",direct" VCS fallback is
# dropped: Thylacine ships no git, so a proxy miss must surface the proxy's
# clear 404/410, not the direct fetcher's confusing "git not found". A host
# needing direct fetches overrides via GOPROXY in the environment.
GOPROXY=https://proxy.golang.org
GOSUMDB=sum.golang.org

# Never auto-download a toolchain: a GOOS=thylacine `go` cannot execute a
# foreign (linux/darwin) toolchain binary, and the host cross-builds must not
# switch off the fork either. See https://go.dev/doc/toolchain for details.
GOTOOLCHAIN=local
